.env
*.swp
*~
DISCORD_POST.md
# .claude/ — pipekit's own Claude Code workspace. NOT ignored wholesale: it
# holds three different kinds of thing and only two of them should be untracked.
#
#   tracked   settings.json  — wires the commit-format hook this repo documents
#                              as enforcement. Untracked, a fresh clone had the
#                              hook documented but not wired.
#   tracked   hooks/         — one small file; tracking it means enforcement
#                              exists on clone rather than after a setup step.
#   ignored   settings.local.json — personal, per-machine.
#   ignored   skills/ rules/ agents/ workflows/ — GENERATED mirrors of tracked
#                              sources (skills/, templates/rules/, agents/,
#                              workflows/). Consuming
#                              projects get these written by sync-method.sh;
#                              pipekit refreshes its own with
#                              scripts/dogfood-sync.sh. Never edit in place —
#                              edit the source and re-run the script.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/skills/
.claude/rules/
.claude/agents/
.claude/workflows/
.claude/worktrees/
temp/
archive/scratch/

# personal notepad — replaces v1 NEXT.md; free-form, never committed
notepad.md

# /work → /verify cross-skill flag markers (consumed by /verify Step 3.5)
.pk-work/
